30c1c06670f8011", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-3fb2eb02f068ee1991a45c2d", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/e35410771198fa6f77dc851b6d5aca5196b62a4c82cdce326959b26018dec5dc.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "e35410771198fa6f77dc851b6d5aca5196b62a4c82cdce326959b26018dec5dc", "user_turn_count": 2, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 519], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "ae20c3ced78c197479d62a2a8281974d1b48ba086be713105de0f955efe21581", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 418], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "27d9bc0d27a8ff7f7616e0b05e6e543c9792aa689e21d988d0bb4311ff16c716", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "**原消息附件**：Q1-S1 → Q1-P → Q1-S2（按原消息的上传顺序）；原图见对应题目章节。\n\n<!-- ORIGINAL_MESSAGE_BEGIN D01 -->\n\n这道题我也是完全无从下手。这道题我倒是看出来了，它给的点是 (1, 0, 1)，方向向量是 (0, 1, 2) 这条直线。\n\n然后我把这个方向向量写成参数式，得到 $x = 1$、$y = t$、$z = 2t + 1$。我的想法是构造一个点 $M(x\\_0, y\\_0, z\\_0)$，它是旋转曲面上的点。这个旋转曲面绕轴旋转，曲面上的每个点到轴的距离是固定的：$\\sqrt{x\\_0^2 + y\\_0^2} = 1$（或者 $x\\_0^2 + y\\_0^2 = 1$）。\n\n我根据这个参数式，得到 $\\sqrt{t^2 + 1} = 1$，进而得到 $t^2 = 0$，即 $t = 0$。把 $t = 0$ 代进去，确实得到了 (1, 0, 1) 这个点，但最后还是没得到旋转曲面方程。\n\n这题我实在无从下手\n\n<!-- ORIGINAL_MESSAGE_END D01 -->\n\n:::\n\n\n::: {.dialogue-message #d02}"}